 Template demo content</div></footer>","pages":{"home":"<section class=\"aw-hero\"><span class=\"aw-lab\">Online art school · live studios · twelve-week terms</span><h1 style=\"margin:18px 0 28px\">Learn to <em>see</em>, then to make.</h1><p style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-bottom:clamp(40px,6vw,80px)\"><a class=\"aw-btn\" href=\"{{p:studios}}\">See the studios</a><a class=\"aw-btn o\" href=\"{{p:progress}}\">Before &amp; after</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"aw-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"aw-lab\" style=\"margin-bottom:22px\">On the wall this term</div><div class=\"aw-wall\"><figure class=\"aw-work xl\" data-k=\"paint\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:16/10;--bg:#e9d8b4;--c1:#c9582b;--c2:#31443a;--x:30%;--y:40%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Still life with pears</b><span>Studio 01, Oil, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work s\" data-k=\"drawing\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:4/5;--bg:#e8e6df;--c1:#222;--c2:#8a8a85;--x:50%;--y:35%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Self-portrait, tired</b><span>Mina K., Charcoal, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work s\" data-k=\"drawing\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:4/5;--bg:#1f2540;--c1:#f2b134;--c2:#e9e4d4;--x:70%;--y:30%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Station at night</b><span>Arvind P., Ink, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work w\" data-k=\"paint\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:5/4;--bg:#f3d5c0;--c1:#2b6f6b;--c2:#c64a3a;--x:35%;--y:60%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Market, Saturday</b><span>Jo T., Gouache, 2025</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work w\" data-k=\"drawing\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:5/4;--bg:#efeee9;--c1:#555;--c2:#a9a9a3;--x:60%;--y:45%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Hands, study no. 7</b><span>Lena W., Graphite, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work s\" data-k=\"paint\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:4/5;--bg:#dce9e4;--c1:#e0a24b;--c2:#4d7a73;--x:40%;--y:55%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Quiet kitchen</b><span>Omar S., Watercolour, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work s\" data-k=\"paint\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:4/5;--bg:#f1e0a8;--c1:#cf3f5b;--c2:#27408b;--x:55%;--y:30%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Neighbours</b><span>Priya D., Acrylic, 2025</span></figcaption></figure></div><p style=\"margin-top:40px\"><a class=\"aw-btn o\" href=\"{{p:wall}}\">See the whole wall</a></p></section>\n<section class=\"aw-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"aw-split\"><div><div class=\"aw-lab\">Progress</div><h2 style=\"font:800 clamp(30px,4.4vw,60px)/1.02 var(--f-head);letter-spacing:-.04em;margin:14px 0 18px\">Twelve weeks, one student.</h2><p style=\"font:400 17px/1.8 var(--f-body);max-width:42ch\">Drag to compare a first drawing with the one made at the end of term. Every student keeps a portfolio of their own.</p></div><div class=\"aw-ba\" id=\"aw-ba\"><div class=\"a\"><span>Week 1</span></div><div class=\"b\"><span>Week 12</span></div><i></i><input type=\"range\" min=\"0\" max=\"100\" value=\"50\" aria-label=\"Compare week 1 and week 12\"></div></div></section><script>(function(){var b=document.getElementById(\"aw-ba\");if(!b)return;var r=b.querySelector(\"input\");function u(){b.style.setProperty(\"--p\",r.value+\"%\")}r.addEventListener(\"input\",u);u()})();</script>","studios":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Studios</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em\">Studios</h1><p class=\"lead\">Four studios, each ten to twelve students and one teacher.</p></div></section><section class=\"aw-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><a class=\"aw-st\" href=\"{{p:studio}}\"><span class=\"n\">01</span><div><h3>Drawing Foundations</h3><p>Line, form, light. The base every other studio stands on.</p><div class=\"meta\"><span>12 weeks</span><span>Beginner</span></div></div><div class=\"aw-pic\" data-l=\"缺图\" style=\"--bg:#e8e6df;--c1:#222;--c2:#8a8a85\"></div></a><a class=\"aw-st\" href=\"{{p:studio}}\"><span class=\"n\">02</span><div><h3>Painting from Life</h3><p>Colour mixing, composition and a finished still life.</p><div class=\"meta\"><span>12 weeks</span><span>Improver</span></div></div><div class=\"aw-pic\" data-l=\"缺图\" style=\"--bg:#e9d8b4;--c1:#c9582b;--c2:#31443a\"></div></a><a class=\"aw-st\" href=\"{{p:studio}}\"><span class=\"n\">03</span><div><h3>Illustration Practice</h3><p>Characters, narrative and building a small series.</p><div class=\"meta\"><span>10 weeks</span><span>Improver</span></div></div><div class=\"aw-pic\" data-l=\"缺图\" style=\"--bg:#f1e0a8;--c1:#cf3f5b;--c2:#27408b\"></div></a><a class=\"aw-st\" href=\"{{p:studio}}\"><span class=\"n\">04</span><div><h3>Portfolio Studio</h3><p>Edit, sequence and present eight finished works.</p><div class=\"meta\"><span>8 weeks</span><span>Advanced</span></div></div><div class=\"aw-pic\" data-l=\"缺图\" style=\"--bg:#dce9e4;--c1:#e0a24b;--c2:#4d7a73\"></div></a></section>","studio":"<section class=\"aw-sec\"><div class=\"aw-split\"><div><div class=\"aw-lab\">Studio 01 · 12 weeks · Beginner</div><h1 style=\"font:800 clamp(38px,6vw,84px)/.98 var(--f-head);letter-spacing:-.045em;color:var(--c-primary);margin:16px 0 20px\">Drawing Foundations</h1><p style=\"font:400 18px/1.8 var(--f-body);max-width:44ch;margin-bottom:26px\">Twelve weekly studios with live critique. You need paper, a 2B pencil and a window.</p><p style=\"display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap\"><a class=\"aw-btn\" href=\"{{p:tuition}}\">Enrol · RM 690</a><a class=\"aw-btn o\" href=\"{{p:progress}}\">See progress</a></p></div>\n<div class=\"faq\" style=\"max-width:none\"><details open><summary>Weeks 1–3 · Line and observation</summary><p>Contour, blind drawing, measuring by eye.</p></details><details><summary>Weeks 4–6 · Light and form</summary><p>Value scales, shading, the cast shadow.</p></details><details><summary>Weeks 7–9 · Composition</summary><p>Thumbnails, cropping, negative space.</p></details><details><summary>Weeks 10–12 · Final study</summary><p>One sustained still life with critique.</p></details></div></div></section>","wall":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Student wall</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em\">Student wall</h1><p class=\"lead\">Work made in the studios this term, shown with permission.</p></div></section><section class=\"aw-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"aw-chips\" role=\"group\" aria-label=\"Filter works\"><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"true\" data-f=\"all\">All</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-f=\"paint\">Paint</button><button type=\"button\" aria-pressed=\"false\" data-f=\"drawing\">Drawing</button></div><div class=\"aw-wall\"><figure class=\"aw-work xl\" data-k=\"paint\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:16/10;--bg:#e9d8b4;--c1:#c9582b;--c2:#31443a;--x:30%;--y:40%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Still life with pears</b><span>Studio 01, Oil, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work s\" data-k=\"drawing\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:4/5;--bg:#e8e6df;--c1:#222;--c2:#8a8a85;--x:50%;--y:35%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Self-portrait, tired</b><span>Mina K., Charcoal, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work s\" data-k=\"drawing\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:4/5;--bg:#1f2540;--c1:#f2b134;--c2:#e9e4d4;--x:70%;--y:30%\" data-l=\"缺图\"></div><figcaption class=\"aw-cap\"><b>Station at night</b><span>Arvind P., Ink, 2026</span></figcaption></figure><figure class=\"aw-work w\" data-k=\"paint\"><div class=\"aw-pic\" style=\"--r:5/4;--bg:#