sions</li><li>Exhibition slot</li></ul><a class=\"aw-btn o\" href=\"#\">Apply</a></div></div></section>","faq":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>FAQ</b></div><h1 style=\"font-family:var(--f-head);font-weight:800;letter-spacing:-.04em\">FAQ</h1></div></section><section class=\"aw-sec\" style=\"padding-top:0\"><div class=\"faq\"><details open><summary>I have never drawn. Is that okay?</summary><p>Drawing Foundations is made for you.</p></details><details><summary>What materials do I need?</summary><p>A short list is sent after enrolment; most is under RM 120.</p></details><details><summary>Is there a portfolio at the end?</summary><p>Yes. You'll finish with 6–8 works and a short statement.</p></details></div></section>","privacy":"<section class=\"pagehead alt\"><div class=\"wrap\"><div class=\"crumbs\"><a href=\"{{p:home}}\">Home</a><span>/</span><b>Privacy policy</b></div><h1 style=\"\">Privacy policy</h1></div></section><section class=\"aw-sec\" style=\"padding-top:20px\"><div class=\"prose\"><p>Replace with your privacy policy: what you collect, why, how long you keep it and how customers can ask for deletion.</p></div></section>","404":"<section class=\"aw-sec\"><div class=\"aw-lab\">Error 404</div><h1 class=\"aw-hero\" style=\"padding:0;font:800 clamp(60px,14vw,200px)/.9 var(--f-head);letter-spacing:-.05em;margin:18px 0 24px\">Blank<br>canvas.</h1><a class=\"aw-btn\" href=\"{{p:home}}\">Back to the school</a></section>"}}